@startuml generation-frontend-call
' Call flow: Frontend → PHP (Yii) → Python (FastAPI) → PHP (Knowledge/Cache) → PHP (AI Gateway) → AI → Response

skinparam {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  ParticipantBorderColor #2E4053
  ParticipantFontColor #1A1A2E
  NoteBorderColor #2E86C1
  ArrowColor #2E86C1
}

box "Frontend (Виджет)" #D5E8D4
  participant "Виджет\nEnergyToolAssistant" as Widget
end box

box "PHP Backend (Yii)" #D4E6F1
  participant "PHP Router\n/generation/chat" as PhpRouter
  participant "GenerationController\n(прокси)" as PhpProxy
  participant "Knowledge API\n/interna/v1/knowledge" as KnowledgeApi
  participant "AI Gateway\n/interna/v1/ai/chat" as AiGateway
end box

box "Python Generation Service\n(FastAPI :8000)" #F5F5F5
  participant "FastAPI /v1/generation/chat" as FastApi
  participant "GenerationService\nanswer()" as GenService
  participant "KnowledgeRouter\nroute()" as Router
  participant "KnowledgeRetriever\nretrieve()" as Retriever
  participant "PHPClient\nHTTP-клиент" as PhpClient
end box

actor "Пользователь" as User

== 1. Пользователь отправляет вопрос ==
User -> Widget: вопрос
Widget -> PhpRouter: POST /api/generation/chat\n{question, messages, category_slugs...}
note right: nginx проксирует /api → PHP backend

PhpRouter -> PhpProxy: actionChat()
note right: Yii routing → GenerationController

== 2. PHP проксирует в Python ==
PhpProxy -> FastApi: POST /v1/generation/chat\n(тело запроса как есть)

== 3. Получение категорий от PHP ==
FastApi -> GenService: answer(request)
GenService -> PhpClient: categories()
PhpClient -> KnowledgeApi: GET /interna/v1/knowledge/categories
KnowledgeApi --> PhpClient: [{slug, name, description}, ...]
PhpClient --> GenService: list of categories

== 4. Роутинг по категориям ==
GenService -> Router: route(question, categories, forced_slugs)
Router --> GenService: [selected_slugs], routing_info

== 5. Получение документов знаний ==
GenService -> Retriever: retrieve(question, selected_slugs, top_k)
Retriever -> PhpClient: retrieve(category_slugs, limit=30)
PhpClient -> KnowledgeApi: POST /interna/v1/knowledge/retrieve\n{categorySlugs, limit}
KnowledgeApi --> PhpClient: [{category, documentId, content?,\n contentUrl, documentUrl, locator, ...}]
PhpClient --> Retriever: items

== 6. Загрузка контента (если не в inline-кэше) ==
Retriever -> PhpClient: fetch_bytes(relative_url)\n(для contentUrl или documentUrl)
PhpClient -> KnowledgeApi: GET /interna/v1/knowledge/.../file
KnowledgeApi --> PhpClient: bytes + content-type
PhpClient --> Retriever: raw bytes

== 7. Кэширование извлечённого текста ==
Retriever -> PhpClient: cache_part(part, content)
PhpClient -> KnowledgeApi: POST /interna/v1/knowledge/parts/{id}/cache\n{documentRevision, partRevision, content}
note right: Graceful degradation —\nошибка кэша не блокирует ответ

== 8. Вызов AI ==
GenService -> PhpClient: chat(system_prompt, messages)
PhpClient -> AiGateway: POST /interna/v1/ai/chat\n{systemPrompt, messages}
AiGateway -> AiGateway: Прокси в OpenAI-совместимый API
AiGateway --> PhpClient: {content, finishReason, usage}
PhpClient --> GenService: AI response

== 9. Формирование и возврат ответа ==
GenService --> FastApi: {answer, sources, routing, debug?}
FastApi --> PhpProxy: 200 JSON
PhpProxy --> PhpRouter: JSON (проксируем как есть)
PhpRouter --> Widget: JSON-ответ
note right: При ошибках:\n502 — PHPServiceError\n504 — Timeout\n500 — Internal error

Widget --> User: ответ + источники

@enduml